<title>USA: Feld Entertainment hires Stuart Snyder as COO.</title>
<headline>Feld Entertainment hires Stuart Snyder as COO.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feld Entertainment Inc on Monday said Stuart Snyder assumed the new position of president and chief operating officer at the company.</p>
<p>It said Snyder previously worked at the Turner Home Entertainment unit of Turner Broadcasting System Inc.</p>
<p>Based in Vienna, Virginia, Feld produces live entertainment shows for casinos in Las Vegas as well as ice skating performances, including &quot;The Wizard of Oz on Ice&quot;.</p>
